license: "Apache-2.0"

abstract: >
  AI Workflow Framework (AWF) is a self-hosted framework for building,
  executing, scheduling, and monitoring visual AI workflows. It combines
  a React-based visual workflow editor with a FastAPI execution engine,
  PostgreSQL persistence, configurable large language model providers,
  local Ollama inference, workflow scheduling, execution history,
  and application integrations.

keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - AI workflows
  - LLM
  - large language models
  - AI agents
  - workflow automation
  - workflow orchestration
  - RAG
  - FastAPI
  - React
  - PostgreSQL
  - Ollama
  - automation

